\" title=\"Favored Soul\">Favored Souls</a> gain up to double spell points from items.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Dragoncrafted_Robe.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Dragoncrafted_Robe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"370\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>An ancient robe imbued with the power of dragons for the rare humanoids that they favored.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Turn in 10 <a href=\"/page/Ancient_Dragon_Relic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ancient Dragon Relic\">Ancient Dragon Relics</a> to Horatin in <a href=\"/page/Gianthold\" title=\"Gianthold\">Gianthold</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201359\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.147 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3767/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23721/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5211/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 6/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n106.64%  137.206     44 Template:IO\n100.00%  128.659